segments.translation_html:
Six branches; seized with the motivation of peace;
Gives a higher rebirth;
Base, pacification, and freedom from fear;
Heap of merit; and possession of perfection.

Those who abandon taking the life of others; theft of others’ wealth;
Impure sexual activity; lying; processed alcohol, dancing, etc.; jewelry, etc.;
High luxurious beds; food in the afternoon; and accepting gold and silver.
Abandoning these ten actions is known as novice vows.
